    <briefdescription>
<para>Doubly linked lists classes. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Traditional doubly linked or low-intrusive doubly linked lists are provided for use cases where a fully intrusive approach is not required. These classes and templates offer a straightforward way to manage collections of objects using the classic doubly linked list structure.</para>
<para>For simpler use cases, such as traditional lists or low-intrusive lists, there are several simpler classes and templates available.   </para>
    </detaileddescription>
